2.6 Shape, Elevation & Sensory Feedback
Corner Radii: Cards 24dp (rounded-3xl), Modal Bottom Sheets & Dialogs 28dp (rounded-[28px]), Primary inputs & pill CTAs 16dp or full pill, inner chips/controls 8–12dp.
Haptics: Trigger a light 12ms haptic tick on set check-off, quick-fill from previous, exercise reorder/drag start, exercise swap, and set tag/RPE/rest selection.
Rest Completion Audio: Two-tone sine chime (660 Hz then 880 Hz, 140ms stagger, 280ms exponential decay) when countdown hits 0:00 and soundEnabled == true.
Reduced Motion: Respect system reduced-motion setting (AnimatorDurationScale == 0), replacing smooth scroll with instant jump.
