Custom Exercise Library Rules:
Persist customExercises: List<String> on-device.
Display normalization: name.trim().replace(Regex("\\s+"), " "). Comparison key: lowercase of display name.
Startup Backfill: Scan all saved routines, completed history, and any active workout; append any exercise not already in the built-in 53 or customExercises to customExercises.
